 "_comment": [
  "Where each club's chart has been published, so a later session can update the right",
  "files instead of rediscovering them. Written by hand after each publishing run; there",
  "is no script that produces it, because publishing is a deliberate act.",
  "Talk-page requests for the Hebrew placements were posted on 16 September 2026, one per article, each naming the file and giving the exact wikitext. 'requested' records that.",
  "",
  "An update is a Commons re-upload under the same 'commons' file name - the article",
  "references a name and Commons serves whatever version that name holds - so 'revision'",
  "is a record of when the chart was placed, not something to keep current.",
  "",
  "'placed': true means the image is in the article. Hebrew articles are all false: he.wikipedia",
  "abuse filter 109 disallows article edits from an account with fewer than 100 edits. The",
  "files are uploaded and ready; only the placement is outstanding. See docs/WIKIPEDIA.md."
 ],
